<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><view class="eyebrow">QINGDONG WORKSPACE</view><view class="heading">让每一份坚持，有人回应。</view><view class="notice warn section">当前为本机原型体验。切换身份用于验证角色差异，实际权限将由后端控制。</view><view wx:if="{{!signedIn}}" class="card section"><text>请先使用模拟账号并确认城市。</text><button class="btn mt" data-url="/pages/account/index" bindtap="go"><image class="feature-entry-icon" src="/images/ui/edit.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>账号与城市</text></button></view><block wx:else><view class="card section"><view class="form-label">当前体验身份</view><picker range="{{roleNames}}" value="{{roleIndex}}" bindchange="roleChange"><view class="picker row"><text>{{roleNames[roleIndex]}}</text><text>⌄</text></view></picker><text class="caption">消费者体验前台；城市运营仅本城；总部维护全局规则。</text></view><view class="grid2 section"><button class="btn soft" data-url="/pages/explore/index" bindtap="go"><image class="feature-entry-icon" src="/images/ui/sun.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>全部功能</text></button><button class="btn soft" data-url="/pages/index/index" bindtap="go"><image class="feature-entry-icon" src="/images/ui/sun.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>返回用户首页</text></button></view><view wx:if="{{role !== 'consumer'}}" class="section"><view class="section-title mb">工作台入口</view><view class="card"><button wx:for="{{operations}}" wx:key="id" class="menu-item" data-url="{{item.route}}" bindtap="go"><view class="grow"><view class="title">{{item.label}}</view><view class="caption">{{item.description}}</view></view><text class="arrow">›</text></button><button class="menu-item" data-url="/pages/weight-review/index" bindtap="go"><view class="grow"><view class="title">体重复核与申诉</view><text class="caption">复核员与主管的任务入口</text></view><text class="arrow">›</text></button></view><button class="btn soft mt" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="jobs">运行一次模拟结算与过期检查</button><view wx:if="{{jobMessage}}" class="notice mt">{{jobMessage}}</view></view></block></block><view class="footnote">轻动 · 让健康成为一种日常</view></view>
